*GALAXIAN

The sinister Empire subjugates more and more 
worlds of the galaxy. Its black shadow has 
already closed over many of them, foretelling 
*years of rule by dark forces.

Now, more than ever, the Empire's fleet is 
vital to it - one of the foundations of its might.
The finest minds have been enlisted to develop 
cutting-edge starfighters, while the Imperial 
Academy conducts accelerated training, turning
out ever more recruits ready to join the swelling
*ranks of the fleet.

This may play into the hands of the rebels, for
whom squadrons of rookies represent an easier 
target - but attacks on them can inflict no less
damage on the Empire than strikes against regular
*formations.

Despite the growing insurgency, its numbers are 
still dwarfed by the Imperial forces, and attacks
on the enemy must be carried out by single ships, 
which demands great skill and courage from the
*pilots...
